{"id": "5fe02cea-f5b3-4f6e-8091-9250e6a43347", "timestamp": "2026-06-04T15:24:03.271173", "source": "agent", "thought": [{"cache_prompt": false, "type": "text", "text": "Good. Now the parser:\n\n"}], "reasoning_content": null, "thinking_blocks": [], "responses_reasoning_item": null, "action": {"command": "cat > /Users/ohama/projs/OpenHandsTests/oh-workdir-planning/arm-c/fsharp/Parser.fsy << 'PARSEREOF'\n%{\n// Parser generated by FsYacc\n// Integer arithmetic with precedence: + - (low), * / (high), () (highest)\n// Left-associative for both + and - and * and /\n%}\n\n%token PLUS MINUS MULT DIV LPAREN RPAREN NUMBER EOF\n%left PLUS MINUS\n%left MULT DIV\n%left UMINUS\n\n%start <int> main\n%type <int> expr\n\n%%\n\n// Grammar structured in precedence tiers:\n// expr   : handles + and - (lowest precedence)\n// term   : handles * and / (higher precedence)\n// factor : handles integers and parenthesized expressions (highest precedence)\n\nmain:\n  | expr = expr; EOF { expr }\n\nexpr:\n  | left = expr; PLUS; right = term { left + right }\n  | left = expr; MINUS; right = term { left - right }\n  | term\n\nterm:\n  | left = term; MULT; right = factor { left * right }\n  | left = term; DIV; right = factor { left / right }\n  | factor\n\nfactor:\n  | n = NUMBER { n }\n  | LPAREN; e = expr; RPAREN { e }\n  | MINUS = factor %prec UMINUS { -left }\nPARSEREOF\necho \"Parser.fsy created.\"", "is_input": false, "timeout": null, "reset": false, "kind": "TerminalAction"}, "tool_name": "terminal", "tool_call_id": "e10e3c5b-2410-418a-8b55-9ca0a4bb3502", "tool_call": {"id": "e10e3c5b-2410-418a-8b55-9ca0a4bb3502", "responses_item_id": null, "name": "terminal", "arguments": "{\"command\": \"cat > /Users/ohama/projs/OpenHandsTests/oh-workdir-planning/arm-c/fsharp/Parser.fsy << 'PARSEREOF'\\n%{\\n// Parser generated by FsYacc\\n// Integer arithmetic with precedence: + - (low), * / (high), () (highest)\\n// Left-associative for both + and - and * and /\\n%}\\n\\n%token PLUS MINUS MULT DIV LPA