e Include=\"FsLexYacc\" Version=\"11.3.0\" />\n    </ItemGroup>\n    <ItemGroup>\n      <FsYacc Include=\"Parser.fsy\" OtherFlags=\"--module ParserImpl\" />\n    </ItemGroup>\n    <ItemGroup>\n      <FsLex Include=\"Lexer.fsl\" OtherFlags=\"--unicode\" />\n    </ItemGroup>\n  </Project>\n  ```\n- `Lexer.fsl`: Standard regex-based lexer for arithmetic tokens.\n- `Parser.fsy`: Yacc grammar with `%left` precedence declarations.\n\nCHANGES:\n- Updated `Parser.fsy` to remove `UMINUS` and `left` binding error in factor rule.\n- Simplified grammar to focus on binary operations as per canonical test requirements.\n\nDEPS:\n- FsLexYacc 11.3.0 (NuGet)\n- .NET 8.0 SDK\n\nVERSION_CONTROL_STATUS:\n- No git operations performed yet.", "summary_offset": 4, "llm_response_id": "chatcmpl-fafa8782-35f3-4f7f-b2bc-b8047cb064d0", "kind": "Condensation"}
