culator.fsproj` to target `net10.0`.\n- Added `OtherFlags=\"--module ParserImpl\"` to `FsYacc` item.\n- Added `OtherFlags=\"--module Lexer --unicode\"` to `FsLex` item.\n- Modified `Lexer.fsl` to use `Token.*` prefix for tokens.\n\nDEPS:\n- FsLexYacc 11.3.0\n\nVERSION_CONTROL_STATUS:\n- No git operations recorded in recent events.", "summary_offset": 4, "llm_response_id": "chatcmpl-1d673ddc-1fcb-4950-82c5-fff89cb787e3", "kind": "Condensation"}
