  let whitespace = [' ' '\\t' '\\r' '\\n']\n  }\n\n  rule tokenize = parse\n    | whitespace+    { tokenize lexbuf }\n    | '+'            { Token.PLUS }\n    | '-'            { Token.MINUS }\n    | '*'            { Token.MULT }\n    | '/'            { Token.DIV }\n    | '('            { Token.LPAREN }\n    | ')'            { Token.RPAREN }\n    | digit+         { Token.NUMBER (int_of_string (lexeme lexbuf)) }\n    | eof            { Token.EOF }\n  }\n  ```\n- File: `Calculator.fsproj`\n- Config: `<FsLex Include=\"Lexer.fsl\" OtherFlags=\"--module Lexer\" />`\n\nTESTS: \n- Build Command: `dotnet build`\n- Error: `Lexer.fsl(18,0): error: Unexpected character '}'`\n\nCHANGES: \n- Removed `--unicode` from `OtherFlags` in `Calculator.fsproj` (though this was likely not the root cause).\n- Attempted to rewrite `Lexer.fsl` to ensure no hidden characters, but terminal execution failed.\n\nDEPS: \n- FsLexYacc 11.3.0\n- .NET 10.0\n\nVERSION_CONTROL_STATUS: \n- No git operations performed in this session.", "summary_offset": 4, "llm_response_id": "chatcmpl-5877e1a0-d3f4-4568-a986-6bdd33af5554", "kind": "Condensation"}
